DESCRIPTION:Discover a delightful mix of vintage treasures\, timeless furn
 ishings\, and charming collectibles in this exciting estate auction! From
  beautifully crafted Pennsylvania House furniture\, marble-top accent tab
 les\, and a classic Lane cedar chest to elegant Fenton art glass\, Wedgwo
 od china\, and a hand-painted Japanese porcelain tea service\, this sale 
 offers something for every taste. Collectors will appreciate vintage comi
 c books\, nostalgic Better Little Books\, Franklin Mint die-cast automobi
 les\, and an assortment of unique decorative pieces\, while home enthusia
 sts can explore beautiful glassware\, antique-style furnishings\, and han
 dcrafted textiles. Additional highlights include a Goebel West Germany na
 tivity scene\, vintage fashion accessories\, artwork\, and an inviting se
 lection of holiday décor. Whether you're searching for a statement piece
 \, adding to a cherished collection\, or simply enjoying the thrill of di
 scovering something unexpected\, this auction is filled with hidden gems 
 just waiting to be found. Don't miss your chance to bid on a little bit o
 f everything!
